#. Nagbar body shown to monthly subscribers who are still billed the older, higher price after a price cut. {premiumProductName} is the short paid product name. {currentPrice} and {newPrice} are monthly currency amounts already formatted and localized by code, and {effectiveDate} is a date already formatted and localized by code; never write an amount or a date into the translation. Keep the tone calm and plain.
#: src/features/premium/config/PriceAnnouncementCampaign.ts
msgid "{premiumProductName} costs less now. Switch from {currentPrice} to {newPrice} a month starting {effectiveDate}, and nothing is charged today."
msgstr "{premiumProductName}-এর দাম এখন কমেছে। {effectiveDate} থেকে মাসে {currentPrice}-এর বদলে {newPrice} দিন, আজ কোনো টাকা কাটা হবে না।"

#. Nagbar body shown to yearly subscribers who are still billed the older, higher price after a price cut. {premiumProductName} is the short paid product name. {currentPrice} and {newPrice} are yearly currency amounts already formatted and localized by code, and {effectiveDate} is a date already formatted and localized by code; never write an amount or a date into the translation. Keep the tone calm and plain.
#: src/features/premium/config/PriceAnnouncementCampaign.ts
msgid "{premiumProductName} costs less now. Switch from {currentPrice} to {newPrice} a year starting {effectiveDate}, and nothing is charged today."
msgstr "{premiumProductName}-এর দাম এখন কমেছে। {effectiveDate} থেকে বছরে {currentPrice}-এর বদলে {newPrice} দিন, আজ কোনো টাকা কাটা হবে না।"

#. Line naming a Plutonium gift purchase the buyer can withdraw from, shown in settings and in the withdrawal dialog. This is the statutory line naming the contract, required for the withdrawal function by EU consumer law (Directive 2023/2673, article 11a) and in Sweden by distansavtalslagen 2 kap. 10 a §. {premiumProductName} is the plan name, such as Plutonium, keep it as is. {date} is the purchase date, such as Dec 4, 2026.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "{premiumProductName} gift, bought on {date}."
msgstr "{premiumProductName} উপহার, {date}-এ কেনা।"

#. Accessible label of the Plutonium page region. premiumProductName is the paid tier name.
#: src/features/premium/components/plutonium_page/PlutoniumPageMessages.ts
msgid "{premiumProductName} page"
msgstr "{premiumProductName} পেজ"

#. Link label that opens the premium perks list. premiumProductName is the premium plan name.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/PerksButton.tsx
msgid "{premiumProductName} perks"
msgstr "{premiumProductName}-এর সুবিধা"

#. Premium subscription card title. premiumProductName is the short paid product name.
#: src/features/premium/utils/PremiumMessageDescriptors.ts
msgid "{premiumProductName} subscription"
msgstr "{premiumProductName} সাবস্ক্রিপশন"

#. Line naming a Plutonium subscription the buyer can withdraw from, shown in settings and in the withdrawal dialog. This is the statutory line naming the contract, required for the withdrawal function by EU consumer law (Directive 2023/2673, article 11a) and in Sweden by distansavtalslagen 2 kap. 10 a §. {premiumProductName} is the plan name, such as Plutonium, keep it as is. {date} is the date of the payment that started the withdrawal period, the first payment or a renewal, such as Dec 4, 2026.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "{premiumProductName} subscription, paid on {date}."
msgstr "{premiumProductName} সাবস্ক্রিপশন, {date}-এ পরিশোধ করা।"

