msgstr "আপনার সার্টিফিকেটে নিচের নাম আর {date}, অর্থাৎ আপনি যেদিন Visionary পেয়েছেন সেই তারিখ দেখাবে।"

#. Body of the confirmation shown before saving an edit to a message published from an announcement channel.
#: src/features/messaging/commands/MessageCommands.tsx
msgid "Your changes go to every community that follows this channel, which can take a minute. Each published message allows 3 quick edits, then 1 every 20 minutes."
